      "statement": "src/index.ts is the flat public API surface, re-exporting all core concern modules (config, jobs, soul, links, sync, init) and all shared utils (deep-merge, fs-helpers, merge-results, profile-name, profile-targets, root-finder), so a single import exposes the whole library.",
