    {
      "id": "claim_63cf36ee9d82448f85dd6faaa51cb240",
      "statement": "mergeJobs feeds a previous run's jobs.json output back in as the base and deduplicates id-less jobs by canonical deep-content equality, making the jobs merge idempotent: repeated merges never grow the jobs list (f(f(base, custom), custom) === f(base, custom)).",
